# Wave W17-Q (Route 124): trench sand — crossing sand over the dark water: a grey-wet sand flecked dark where the trench’s depth shows through the shallows at the lane’s edges (design: cheerful island water with a drowned world underneath it; the dark water mid-route is a dive trench). Route 124’s own sand — wetter and greyer than Route 109’s bright bay gold and Route 122’s ash-pale grave sand: this sand has deep water under it, and it knows.
